@startuml
title Containerized Song Mood Web Application - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

actor "End User" as user
actor "Operator" as operator
actor "Data Inspector" as inspector

cloud "Genius API\n(External Dependency)" as genius

node "Docker Host" as docker {
  node "Docker Network\n(Internal service communication - COM-002)" as dnet {
    node "frontend\nReact SPA\n(Container: frontend)" as fe
    node "backend\nFastAPI API\n(Container: backend)" as be
    database "Elasticsearch\n(Container: elasticsearch)" as es
    node "Kibana\n(Container: kibana)" as kb
  }
}

' External interactions
user --> fe : Browser HTTPS\nSong mood lookup UI (COM-001, UI-001, FR-001)
operator --> kb : Browser Access\nData inspection UI (UI-002, FR-006)
inspector --> kb : Browser Access\nData inspection UI (UI-002, FR-006)

' Service-to-service interactions
fe --> be : REST/JSON API\nSong lookup requests (API-001)
be --> es : HTTP(S) REST\nQuery/Index songs & moods (API-002,\nFR-002, FR-004, FR-005)
kb --> es : HTTP(S)\nData inspection (API-004, FR-006)
be --> genius : HTTPS\nSearch missing songs (API-003, FR-003, COM-003)

' Notes for responsibilities and constraints
note right of fe
Provides browser-accessible UI for song mood lookup.
- Renders React SPA (FR-001, C-001)
- Communicates with backend (API-001)
end note

note right of be
Handles song lookup and storage workflows (C-002):
- Retrieves mood for known songs from Elasticsearch (FR-002)
- Stores song-mood associations (FR-004)
- Supports fast retrieval for later requests (FR-005)
- Searches missing songs via Genius API (FR-003)
Dependencies:
- Elasticsearch availability (Assumption/Dependency)
- Genius API availability (Assumption/Dependency)
end note

note right of es
Authoritative store for song and mood data (NFR-004, C-003).
Data formats handled:
- Song record (DEF-001, DR-001)
- Artist metadata (DEF-002, DR-002) when used
- Mood association (DEF-003, DR-003)
Retrieval efficiency for later requests (NFR-002).
end note

note right of kb
Auxiliary data UI for inspecting stored Elasticsearch data (FR-006, C-004, UI-002).
Depends on Elasticsearch availability.
end note

note right of genius
External dependency (C-005, C-007):
- Invoked when requested song is missing from storage (FR-003)
- Returns song search results (DEF-004)
Not an internal container service.
end note

note top of dnet
Multi-tier Dockerized deployment (NFR-001, C-006):
- Separate container services: frontend (React), backend (FastAPI),
  Elasticsearch, Kibana
Internal service communication over Docker network (COM-002).
end note

note "Project dataset scope: English songs only; no runtime language rejection specified (DR-004, C-008).\nNo runtime classifier/model server assumed unless added separately (C-009)." as scopeNote
scopeNote .. be

@enduml
